  "notes": "{尽力|じんりょく} is a formal term for making great effort or exerting oneself.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ご{尽力|じんりょく}いただき (for your efforts - honorific)\n- {尽力|じんりょく}してまいります (I/we will do our best - humble)\n- {尽力|じんりょく}を{惜|お}しまない (spare no effort)\n\nUSAGE NOTE: More formal than {頑張|がんば}る or {努力|どりょく}. Often used in business correspondence and formal speeches to acknowledge or promise dedicated effort.",
